#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Certify the finite doubling cubes generated by the T1 and T2 H9/14 seeds.

Each seed has four mutually orthogonal doubling walls.  Gluing all seed
chambers in the elementary abelian reflection subgroup generated by any
subset of those walls gives a convex finite-volume Coxeter chamber.  This
certificate constructs every nonempty subset exactly, classifies the
resulting labelled diagrams, and independently replays GMP extreme rays,
the chosen time sheet, and Vinberg's literal edge/cusp criterion for one
representative of every isomorphism type.
"""

